  "content": "<div align=\"center\">\n    <img alt=\"圖示\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/sablebarehanded.png\" width=\"180\">\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config\">\n    <img alt=\"布料設定API\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_vector.svg\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sablebarehanded?loader=neoforge#download\">\n    <img alt=\"NeoForge\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Hyperbole-Devs/vectors/refs/heads/neoforge_badges/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/sablebarehanded?loader=fabric#download\">\n    <img alt=\"Fabric\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sablebarehanded\">\n    <img alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/JuaanP/SableBarehanded\">\n    <img alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"36\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/available/github_vector.svg\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/juaanp\">\n    <img alt=\"Ko-fi 贊助\" height=\"36\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular_vector.svg\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n<h1 align=\"center\">Sable：赤手空拳</h1>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <i>一個 Sable 的附加模組，讓玩家能直接用雙手拆解、移動、旋轉和重組方塊。完全不需要工具！</i>\n</p>\n\n---\n\n### 🧱 拆解與搬運\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/pumpkin_detach.gif\" width=\"100%\">\n      <br>\n      <sub><b>擬真物理：</b>蹲下並向後走，同時按住左右鍵來拉動！</sub>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/chest_detach.gif\" width=\"100%\">\n      <br>\n      <sub><b>智能連接：</b>自動偵測並安全拆解如雙倍儲物箱等相連結構。</sub>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n### 🫳 抓取、推動與旋轉\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/survival.gif\" width=\"100%\">\n      <br>\n      <sub><b>抓取與旋轉：</b>將子結構懸浮在半空中，並使用自訂按鍵自由旋轉。</sub>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/car_push.gif\" width=\"100%\">\n      <br>\n      <sub><b>推動與互動：</b>施加物理力來移動重物、載具或結構。</sub>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n### 🔨 建造與拆解\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/slam.gif\" width=\"100%\">\n      <br>\n      <sub><b>拆解：</b>將抓取的子結構甩向方塊，或按下 <b>[Q]</b> 將其放回世界中。</sub>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/place_toggle.gif\" width=\"100%\">\n      <br>\n      <sub><b>物理放置：</b>按下 <b>[X]</b> 切換放置模式，直接將方塊作為物理物件放置。</sub>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n### ⚔️ 生存模式友好\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/strength01.gif\" width=\"100%\">\n      <br>\n      <sub>💪 <b>重量與張力：</b>重型結構會讓你拖得很吃力，手臂伸太遠時連接甚至會斷開。</sub>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/strength02.gif\" width=\"100%\">\n      <br>\n      <sub>🧪 <b>藥水與飢餓：</b>力量藥水能倍增舉重力，但搬運重物會真實地消耗你的飢餓值。</sub>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n### 🌌 創造模式友好\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/creative01.gif\" width=\"100%\">\n      <br>\n      <sub>🦾 <b>無限力量：</b>突破所有物理限制，擁有無限力量與最大結構穩定性。</sub>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuaanP/ModResources/refs/heads/main/SableBarehanded/showcase/creative02.gif\" width=\"100%\">\n      <br>\n      <sub>🔭 <b>無限範圍：</b>從幾乎任何距離抓取、拉動和操縱巨大結構。</sub>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n---\n\n### 🎮 沉浸式操作\n<sup>請確保你**空手**才能與物理引擎互動：</sup>\n\n| 動作                      |操作方式                                                              |\n| --------------------------- |--------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| <strong>抓取</strong> |同時按住 <strong>左鍵 + 右鍵</strong>。              |\n| <strong>調整距離</strong> |滾動滑鼠滾輪，將抓取的子結構拉近或推遠。 |\n| <strong>組裝方塊</strong> |<strong>蹲下</strong> + 同時按住 <strong>左鍵 + 右鍵</strong>，然後向後走來拉動！ |\n| <em>抬起可互動方塊（如儲物箱）</em> |<em>先按住 <strong>左鍵</strong>，再按住 <strong>右鍵</strong> 以避免開啟介面。</em> |\n| <em>抬起即時破壞方塊（如TNT）</em> |<em>先按住 <strong>右鍵</strong>，再按住 <strong>左鍵</strong> 以避免破壞。</em> |\n| <strong>旋轉</strong>     |按住 <strong>[R]</strong> 並移動滑鼠。                        |\n| <strong>切換旋轉軸心</strong> |旋轉時按住 <strong>[Shift]</strong>（重心 ↔ 抓取點）。 |\n| <strong>拆解</strong> |抓取子結構時按下 <strong>[Q]</strong>（或將它甩向方塊！）。 |\n| <strong>物理放置</strong> |按下 <strong>[X]</strong> 切換 — 之後放置的方塊將以物理物件形式生成。 |\n\n---\n\n#### ⚙️ 完全可設定\n<sub>本模組的每個面向都能透過遊戲內設定選單（Cloth Config）自訂，以符合你的遊戲風格或伺服器需求。</sub>",
